  "analysis_md": "设函数$f(x,y)=x^y,$取$x=1,y=2,\\Delta x=0.04,\\Delta y=0.02,$则$f(1,2)=1,$\n\n$f_x(x,y)=yx^{y-1},\\ f_y(x,y)=x^y\\ln x,\\ f_x(1,2)=2,\\ f_y(1,2)=0,$\n\n由二元函数全微分近似计算公式的$(1.04)^{2.02}\\approx1+2\\times0.04+0\\times0.02=1.08.$",
